<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - Alumni Connect</title>
    <meta name="description" content="How Alumni Connect collects, uses, and deletes your LinkedIn profile data.">
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><rect width='100' height='100' rx='22' fill='%235865F2'/></svg>">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
      tailwind.config = {
        theme: {
          extend: {
            colors: {
              linkedin: '#0a66c2',
              pageBg: '#f3f2ef',
              cardBorder: '#e0dfdc',
              textPrimary: '#191919',
              textSecondary: '#666666'
            }
          }
        }
      }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-pageBg text-textPrimary min-h-screen p-8 font-sans antialiased">
    <div class="bg-white max-w-3xl mx-auto rounded-xl p-10 shadow-sm border border-cardBorder">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-textSecondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <p>Welcome to Alumni Connect. We respect your privacy and only request the data necessary to provide networking services within our Discord server.</p>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-textPrimary mt-6">Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>When you connect your LinkedIn account we request the <code class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 px-1 rounded">openid</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 px-1 rounded">profile</code> and <code class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 px-1 rounded">email</code> scopes, and store: your LinkedIn subject identifier, name, email address and profile picture URL. Your LinkedIn access and refresh tokens are encrypted at rest and used only to maintain the connection.</p>
            <p>Details you enter yourself in Discord &mdash; your current title, skills and role tier &mdash; are stored alongside your Discord user ID.</p>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-textPrimary mt-6">How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>Your information is used solely to display your profile in our Discord Alumni Directory (if you explicitly opt-in) and to facilitate networking requests between community members.</p>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-textPrimary mt-6">Data Sharing</h2>
            <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties. Your data is strictly confined to the database powering this Discord bot.</p>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-textPrimary mt-6">Your Choices</h2>
            <p>Your profile only appears in the Alumni Directory, and can only receive networking requests, if you explicitly opt in. You can change either setting at any time with <code class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 px-1 rounded">/edit-directory-profile</code> in Discord.</p>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-textPrimary mt-6">Data Deletion</h2>
            <p>Typing <code class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 px-1 rounded">/disconnect-linkedin</code> in the Discord server revokes the connection and erases your LinkedIn identifiers, stored tokens, name, headline, profile picture and public profile URL, and switches off directory visibility and networking requests.</p>
            <p>A minimal record keyed to your Discord user ID is retained so the bot can recognise you if you reconnect. To have that record removed entirely, contact a server administrator.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">
            <a href="/" class="text-linkedin font-semibold hover:underline">&larr; Back Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
